WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:01.281
You ever had a first love?

00:00:03.156 --> 00:00:04.562
Yeah, who hasn't, right?

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.872
My first love was football.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.494
I was raised five years in Iowa,

00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:11.733
-and...
-CROWD MEMBERS: Yeah!

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:14.283
You from Iowa?

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.019
Hey, man, let me ask you
somethin'.

00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:17.515
What do you think
about this electricity?

00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:19.661
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:23.643
-(RIMSHOT)
-(CACKLES)

00:00:24.318 --> 00:00:25.764
That's just funny.

00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:29.150
(CACKLES)

00:00:30.249 --> 00:00:32.279
Ah, god, quit it, Terry.

00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:36.545
And I used to stand in front
of the Sears and Roebuck window

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.416
on Main Street in Clinton, Iowa.

00:00:39.691 --> 00:00:41.010
CROWD MEMBER: I'm from there!

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.945
You stood there? You too?
What is this?

00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:44.231
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:46.897
Don't talk unless I ask you to.

00:00:48.671 --> 00:00:50.685
I'm being paid up here.
Don't forget.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.600
You're not getting paid.
No, you paid.

00:00:53.925 --> 00:00:56.444
Matter of fact, you can talk.
I don't care.

00:00:58.944 --> 00:01:02.656
But you stood there
at the Sears window.

00:01:02.981 --> 00:01:05.713
And I looked in and they had
all the Hawkeye stuff.

00:01:06.237 --> 00:01:09.536
And I love-- and get this,
it was like one of those,

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.368
what do you call it?
Premonition?

00:01:11.468 --> 00:01:12.966
-Is that what you call it?
-CROWD MEMBER 2: Premonition.

00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:14.342
Yeah, that. Who said that?

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:15.917
Where'd you graduate?

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:19.985
You got a college degree?
You gotta. That's a big word.

00:01:20.585 --> 00:01:22.545
Premonition, yeah, that's good.
Can you spell it?

00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:24.970
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:25.995 --> 00:01:28.893
So I'm prem-- I'm pre--
I'm premonitioning.

00:01:28.993 --> 00:01:30.185
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.682
And I'm seeing that
black and gold helmet

00:01:33.182 --> 00:01:35.429
and all that uniform
and I see that football there.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.441
I'm like, "God, if Santa Claus
will bring me a football,

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:38.899
I'll be the happiest guy
in the world."

00:01:39.311 --> 00:01:40.311
And I got it.

00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:42.491
And I got my first football,
and it was like...

00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:46.556
I smelled it,
put my hands on it.

00:01:47.031 --> 00:01:48.959
It was just love at first touch.

